  "description": "Flat-earthers run genuinely careful experiments whose results refute their own theory — then explain the results away on camera. The film stays inside the community without contempt, interested in the machinery that keeps a refuted model alive: conferences, status, loyalty, expulsion. Its real subject is much larger than flat earth.\n\nMeet real Flat Earthers, a small but growing contingent of people who firmly believe in a conspiracy to suppress the truth that the Earth is flat.",
